<title>USA: Chips and Technologies hit with fourth suit.</title>
<headline>Chips and Technologies hit with fourth suit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chips and Technologies Inc said another class-action lawsuit has been filed against the company in connection with Intel Corp's pending buyout offer.</p>
<p>The suit is the fourth shareholder suit filed against the company to date in connection with Intel's offer of $17.50 per share, Chips and Technologies said.</p>
<p>The most recent suit was filed in Santa Clara County Superior Court in California. The three other suits were filed in Delaware, the company said.</p>
<p>Chips and Technologies closed Tuesday at 16-15/16.</p>
</text>
